Subject: [PATCH] Beginnings of ARM64 Windows support.

wine-mono's mono fork, merge request !176 (Esme Povirk, merged 2026-01-13):
https://gitlab.winehq.org/mono/mono/-/merge_requests/176

Applied verbatim. Unity's 2022.3 branch has no Windows-ARM64 port of its own; wine-mono's arm64 Windows
port (merge requests 176, 195, 215, 218, 229, 236 and 237, in that order) is the base the ARM64EC layer
(0009) builds on.

